{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_0","type":"agent_message","text":"{\"additional_concerns\":[\"The circular says the measures “will take immediate effect” in u1 but also sets 28 November 2025 as the Effective Date in u9. The date used by the rule, and the legally relevant assessment event, require clarification from the referenced FAQs.\",\"The legacy flag fixes the no-approval condition at 28 November 2025. The transition sentence does not explicitly specify that snapshot date or establish how an application granted approval later affects eligibility.\",\"The rule's FALSE result must remain limited to failure to establish this relief; neither an exception nor failure of home-jurisdiction compliance independently establishes a current approval duty.\",\"The circular does not define novel or complex features, local policy implications, or the operational requirements in the referenced FAQs. The supplied external dependency records have null source hashes, so those materials cannot be treated as available authority.\"],\"checks\":[{\"authority\":{\"dependency_ids\":[],\"rationale\":\"The SFC permission is stated in the circular; no additional external authority is needed to assess this contextual claim.\",\"status\":\"NONE_DECLARED\"},\"candidate_id\":\"node.00787ab10a284a072204b281\",\"claim_id\":\"claim.04ad83aa3d5a46613db4d337\",\"executable_correspondence\":{\"rationale\":\"The rule decides relief eligibility, not the SFC's enforcement discretion.\",\"representation_quotes\":[],\"status\":\"NOT_APPLICABLE\"},\"followup_questions\":[],\"question_relation\":{\"evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"It may make follow-up enquiries and/or take appropriate regulatory actions in case of non-compliance to ensure investor protection.\",\"unit_id\":\"d97b56331f41a.u12.2069\"}],\"question_hash\":\"9a15824488aefc9b788c86dd28fcf5b92ed5127c4df45c39af0b51987cbfb093\",\"rationale\":\"Enforcement after non-compliance does not determine whether item (ii) removes prior approval.\",\"status\":\"NOT_APPLICABLE_TO_THIS_QUESTION\"},\"source_support\":{\"evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"It may make follow-up enquiries and/or take appropriate regulatory actions in case of non-compliance to ensure investor protection.\",\"unit_id\":\"d97b56331f41a.u12.2069\"}],\"rationale\":\"The permission and its condition are explicit.\",\"status\":\"SUPPORTED\"}},{\"authority\":{\"dependency_ids\":[],\"rationale\":\"The stated aim appears in the circular; external authority would be needed only to turn supervision into a separate operational test.\",\"status\":\"NONE_DECLARED\"},\"candidate_id\":\"node.00787ab10a284a072204b281\",\"claim_id\":\"claim.0f937493ef455b99dc34078c\",\"executable_correspondence\":{\"rationale\":\"The rule tests home-jurisdiction compliance but contains no separate home-regulator-supervision fact; the claim describes an aim, not an express extra condition.\",\"representation_quotes\":[\"home_requirements_met: The selected change complies with the applicable requirements of the fund's home jurisdiction. (truth value)\"],\"status\":\"NOT_APPLICABLE\"},\"followup_questions\":[\"Do the relevant FAQs impose home-regulator supervision as a separate eligibility condition for item (ii)?\"],\"question_relation\":{\"evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"These measures aim at facilitating UCITS funds in implementing changes that are subject to their home regulator’s supervision\",\"unit_id\":\"d97b56331f41a.u1.190\"}],\"question_hash\":\"9a15824488aefc9b788c86dd28fcf5b92ed5127c4df45c39af0b51987cbfb093\",\"rationale\":\"This is context for the measures, but the aim alone does not establish an independent relief condition.\",\"status\":\"NOT_APPLICABLE_TO_THIS_QUESTION\"},\"source_support\":{\"evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"These measures aim at facilitating UCITS funds in implementing changes that are subject to their home regulator’s supervision\",\"unit_id\":\"d97b56331f41a.u1.190\"}],\"rationale\":\"The statement accurately describes the stated aim without asserting a separat